OL,3,GNEWSATynwald members to see unredacted
OL,4,Awindfarm documents
OL,5,
OL,6,FTynwald members will have the
OL,7,Fopportunity to privately view the
OL,8,Funredacted agreements for the Mooir
OL,9,FVannin Wind Farm.
OL,11,FThe proposals could see 87 turbines
OL,12,Fbuilt six to 12 miles (11.1km to
OL,13,F22.2km) off the eastern coast from
OL,14,FMaughold.
OL,16,FIt comes after Garff MHK Richard
OL,17,FHenthorn withdrew a motion in the court
OL,18,Fon Tuesday calling for its publication
OL,19,Fprior to the issue being debated at
OL,20,Fnext month's sitting.
